an establishment in India and any other establishment outside India;
an establishment in a State or Union territory and any other establishment outside that State or Union territory; or
an establishment in a State or Union territory and any other establishment being a business vertical registered within that State or Union territory, then such establishments shall be treated as establishments of distinct persons. As per the above Explanation, an establishment of a person in India and another establishment of the said person outside India are considered as establishments of distinct persons.

